[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2475656838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99216#issuecomment-2475656838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99216","id":2475656838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Tj4aG","user":{"login":"PhairZ","id":123702514,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1-M8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123702514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T07:59:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T07:59:12Z","body":"One way to solve this might be to change the values from being an Enum to a string and using an InputEventListener to detect Input, same way that the Input Map works. or just ditch the mouse button options and rather use the Editor Settings > Shortucts instead.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2475656838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697770334","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99216#issuecomment-2697770334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99216","id":2697770334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gzLVe","user":{"login":"tamask","id":166323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjMyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask","html_url":"https://github.com/tamask","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T14:12:15Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T14:17:07Z","body":"I'm experiencing this also with 4.4-stable. I have pan unmodified and orbit modified to use shift, and can no longer swap them in the editor UI. And unfortunately, you can't edit the editor_settings-4.4.tres manually (i.e. the `shortcuts` property) because they're reset every time godot is started, forcing one of the presets (see `editor/editor_node.cpp:8089`).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697770334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697813878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99216#issuecomment-2697813878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99216","id":2697813878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gzV92","user":{"login":"tamask","id":166323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjMyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask","html_url":"https://github.com/tamask","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tamask/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T14:23:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T14:23:28Z","body":"Actually, I missed an important detail previously: if you set the navigation scheme to 'Custom', no preset it written on editor startup, so as a workaround for now you can indeed set your shortcuts manually in the `editor_settings-4.4.tres` file. In my case, the edits looked something like:\n\n```ini\n[sub_resource type=\"InputEventKey\" id=\"InputEventKey_ctrl\"]\nkeycode = 4194326\n\n[sub_resource type=\"InputEventKey\" id=\"InputEventKey_shift\"]\nkeycode = 4194325\n\n[resource]\n...\neditors/3d/navigation/navigation_scheme = 3\nshortcuts = [\n{\"name\": \"spatial_editor/viewport_pan_modifier_1\", \"shortcuts\": []},\n{\"name\": \"spatial_editor/viewport_pan_modifier_2\", \"shortcuts\": []},\n{\"name\": \"spatial_editor/viewport_orbit_modifier_1\", \"shortcuts\": [SubResource(\"InputEventKey_shift\")]},\n{\"name\": \"spatial_editor/viewport_orbit_modifier_2\", \"shortcuts\": []},\n{\"name\": \"spatial_editor/viewport_zoom_modifier_1\", \"shortcuts\": [SubResource(\"InputEventKey_ctrl\")]},\n{\"name\": \"spatial_editor/viewport_zoom_modifier_2\", \"shortcuts\": []}\n]\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697813878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]